From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:49:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: s800-0-3: Add the SoC performance state

The PMGR register that selects the SoC and memory performance states,
for apple-pmgr-misc, at the same address and with the same layout as
on the T8010.

[Orchard: from orchard PR #122, commit 5775e3ed; unchanged]

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s800-0-3.dtsi | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s800-0-3.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s800-0-3.dtsi
index 3277a73bb..779118fe3 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s800-0-3.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/s800-0-3.dtsi
@@ -326,6 +326,12 @@ touchclk: clock-controller@78000 {
 			};
 		};
 
+		pmgr_misc: power-management@20e068000 {
+			compatible = "apple,s8000-pmgr-misc";
+			reg = <0x2 0x0e068000 0x0 0x4>;
+			reg-names = "soc-ps";
+		};
+
 		aic:interrupt-controller@20e100000 {
 			compatible = "apple,s8000-aic", "apple,aic";
 			reg = <0x2 0x0e100000 0x0 0x100000>;
